OL,3,GNEWSAProtest held over plans to close
OL,4,AEnfield schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents, pupils and staff have
OL,7,Fprotested against plans that could see
OL,8,Fthree north London schools close
OL,9,Fbecause of falling pupil numbers.
OL,11,FCampaigners gathered outside Enfield
OL,12,FCivic Centre, ahead of an overview and
OL,13,Fscrutiny committee meeting on Tuesday
OL,14,Fevening, to oppose proposals affecting
OL,15,FBishop Stopford School, Starks Field
OL,16,FPrimary School and Suffolks Primary
OL,17,FSchool.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
