OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAProtest held over plans to close
OL,4,AEnfield schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plans were put forward by Enfield
OL,7,FCouncil's Conservative administration
OL,8,Fbut were later "called in" by Labour
OL,9,Fcouncillors, triggering further
OL,10,Fscrutiny before they can progress.
OL,12,FThe council said it was committed to a
OL,13,F"fair, transparent and evidence-based
OL,14,Fconsultation" and would consider all
OL,15,Fresponses before making any decision.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
